        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Lexicon Branding, Sony\n- Products: Pentium, BlackBerry, PowerBook, Zune, Swiffer, Febreze, Subaru Outback, Subaru Forester, Toyota Scion, DeskJet, Dasani, OnStar\n- Places: Metreon\n- Hospitality Brands: Embassy Suites Hotels\n\nFacts:\n- Lexicon Branding devised the brand names Pentium, BlackBerry, PowerBook, Zune, Swiffer, Febreze, Subaru Outback, Forester, Toyota Scion, DeskJet, Dasani, OnStar, Embassy Suites Hotels, and Metreon.\n- Sony intended the 85 million dollar Metreon project to serve both as a theme park and gallery for Sony products and as a way to reinforce a sophisticated image for the Sony brand.",
